    <string name="gh_open">Enter the circle</string>
    <string name="gh_rules">One player is secretly the Winker. Winks happen in person, not on the phone. Guests confirm “I was winked at”; each report uses one attempt. At zero attempts a guest is out, but stays connected. When one guest remains, they guess the Winker. A correct guess earns that guest one point; a wrong guess earns the Winker one point. Reports rely on honest play. No detectives or role announcements before results.</string>
